{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2fb9767190cf8939c9ae0f6ea742368af8bb9c443c1252781f78e491616dbc72",
      "text": "Yes! This is a business opportunity!!\nDo you see it!? Alk, Shota...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0189bcade3caec13ec24aa633ea6f486a1a614a02efb1e8d2ab81fdca62b5fb2",
      "text": "White Fest, an event unique to\nPalpebra! A chance to push the\nFarlands' famous confections!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e12d3ee07e0ab7c3cb2326105a73815ba91bc85951d018ba7c189cb7051f9df7",
      "text": "I'll link the confectionery trade and\nthicken our pipeline to Palpebra!\nIsn't this a task for a Swes like me?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "17": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:227d732a7c04db9fd44bf9649749c1f92bb49295fe06d0cedd286aa07cb4d217",
      "text": "Wow, he's so full of life...\nAs long as he's enjoying himself, I\nguess.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c180439bffa26d786d83707198b4b886d3c6d97c38c115c13740950f4a906554",
      "text": "Wait, though. Working again? Didn't\nLibby say he was too busy for\nValentine's Fest, too?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "26": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:42e667852859ec4890d0638b2ec35fc1a7c9fccc8586bdcd37e0045812118d43",
      "text": "Libby!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "31": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:572006b837207101c3cb37a6c60b14f901b63c590a071e656c636313d2e219a6",
      "text": "S-sorry, Shota...! But now is the\ntime to expand my connections...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "34": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:48a2a260f9642bc314d10cdcdfab91a27b14d31df716d662144f07190dad5461",
      "text": "Tomorrow I also meet a famed\nPalpebran businesswoman. We'll\ntour White Fest together!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "39": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b7ca02424f6815078c9697ef25df23e11150109706d3b8b3145d502ee0d0c555",
      "text": "T-that means...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "42": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:904d32a5fc17c9f4dae7a11e67288d9be6c48e64669efa93add5ff7904b36fca",
      "text": "A date, right? No way... I heard\nyou've never once pulled off\na pickup...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "46": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2123068ca3c772d9b7e4f9ef21918fd0e024e09b31be57fa3fdd4da1c7290a2d",
      "text": "Heh, you're mistaken, Shota. Mere\nflirting and escorting are not to be\nspoken of in the same breath.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "50": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0e3bef11ff3b0b16eee1735ee2d7ceaec3c046cf73efd5d8275f9ef18614b412",
      "text": "An escort respects his partner,\nthen brings her onto equal footing.\nThat is a fine negotiating skill!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "54": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fae1c0a4f47dc79bfab37e007c4072308a20a310041d648398ef7b529ea88bcc",
      "text": "Look forward to it, gentlemen! I'll\nmake this negotiation a success!\nThanks for the meal! Ha ha ha...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "58": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:05dd0581bc5b6850d14ea86b4f014db80f033c1892047abfd38143c2021943c0",
      "text": "It's today, y'know. The day Libby\nhas his date. ............Aren't you\ncurious?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "63": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1092b437b2cff797ea2a6dd7437527da5b2ac34ccda1d35c93f1c9720c377aa2",
      "text": "............I am. But no.\nThat'd be too nosy. It's\nstill work for him—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "67": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:46552debbc2f808d05a30fa867a3829d7e3cd329faa392d40cd599390aee406e",
      "text": "Now, give me your hand.\nI wouldn't want us to get separated.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "71": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:58ddb6fb4cc2550d21c47ded81317df4cec113c52f8407758d87420f91381645",
      "text": "...How gentle you are.\nAre you used to women?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "73": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:075144e7059df2072437ef8d12bf543ba45f97213a96c21f4130299914e1d0f9",
      "text": "No one has made my heart race like\nthis before you, my lady.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "75": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:952c6f4db197a47b673a506749730a4c5d8f161d47fbb77b916512bedb066bd4",
      "text": "I'm neither lying nor flattering.\nI want us to be equals.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "78": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de194d5e1d3ed7b7f1f86896229968b841b0ad31762a55b92249282fecd01777",
      "text": "...Such a sweltering line. Equals is\nthe biggest lie of all—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "81": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c6ceb37a48f80946601c61bd841019323a762d784da03e3d36a64e472e497d75",
      "text": "I want to hold this hand because\nit is yours.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "83": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a33aea4817070c38d9be09a42839681f37c3b4cfdc21739d342153f6372f5479",
      "text": "Won't you at least believe that?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "93": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9545481283a763530822767864dc2df70f6798c753e42e3dedb10ab157d2be09",
      "text": "Drop the formalities. ...You do\nmean us to be equals, right?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "96": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d6121dc4835de29ed1978100eaa431deff4187e5ed21c021b5e639667d66047a",
      "text": "Heh... yes, you're right! There's a\nconfectioner ahead who's in talks\nto partner with us. Let's go.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "100": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:74feecbfce16e747145bee7bcbe6cae17ed3386d906f96312c75f1b99c1834c9",
      "text": "...W-was that Libram?\nIt's not an impostor, right...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "106": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5672f24a1d5bd7aa02b592ade84a46dadf9bccc06c99c79728b73c433326df3a",
      "text": "...Why!? I believed in him... I\nbelieved he was another good-looking\nguy like me, and yet...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "110": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:18c11176da8ea8d792d09a11abfcac660a0e8a1376a7e6e377b248806c635812",
      "text": "Ugh...\nI kind of agree, and I hate that.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "113": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:dfedce3f0c5541432589fdb1ddbab07e4e7588c777dcfaaf34414e277867b60c",
      "text": "...Today wasn't bad. How long has it\nbeen since I walked through town so\nrelaxed...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "115": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ed2eb1fd614c0e12f3f173b6bc92c75e60e532b22f576bf02fc5c1db231d5447",
      "text": "I'm glad to hear it. I should thank\nthese pancakes.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "118": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aff8c48aa9e6fc710f9a58d2d60f587a3210d6291f18565a00d7099304ca47c5",
      "text": "You're a good man. Wise and honest.\nYou taught me the Farlands' merits\nprecisely, and cherish Palpebra's too.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "121": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fc10aefd636e89a7a3e4f71e961c84005cf0ba1ed2b53c0f06809e25103d03a1",
      "text": "What an honor. I think the same\nof you—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "123": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:44168136dcfc4ed2177e3634a979bc714a1c50066599d51b4bed0b0b5674a115",
      "text": "That's why I'll tell you. Getting in\nmy good graces will profit you\nnothing.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:726cdf3f25dc0a8a3e4d9b4d07611dca3097fb41b22523dff40939db874d4e33",
      "text": "Remember the ideal you told me about\nearlier?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "128": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d98f41af9cf086874eb7f8148984414aad45c087250bed8652c3eb2818a94485",
      "text": "...Competing to maximize both our\nprofits. That 'coexistence and mutual\nprosperity' is the finest trade—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8d66a906bf94dbca0f30d31be4ba42db33d73e3c6cc08b2eeb016b6974f49e87",
      "text": "But I'm only propped up by my house's\nname and face. I can't even choose\nwhat to invest in, like you.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "133": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a4317ccfa2f4f788fcce49cc67cb3b965573e433763e8131452b7c262be31d08",
      "text": "...Your words are idealism.\nThere's nothing I can do—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "136": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ba75b5dc59e1ef10913ed842da61fbb2b541058357da683300f9b414595d858b",
      "text": "But you want to choose it, don't you?\nGrace.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "140": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:74f2a09e27a8bb91860a76f1bb72a8520f542be4725f7c033f62aa011374f87e",
      "text": "You want to invest in good things and\npeople. You hear talk of mutual\nprosperity and long for that ideal—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "143": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6f48dd274b7765beec215c6f52b117f0fbc3cb90bd6a1dd78e5939d20378b07e",
      "text": "You're just like me.\nA merchant to the point of absurdity!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "146": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b03d8585f6fa73e238e05cd3e707d17ce66bdae00428851ce8dcb87857e7a78",
      "text": "...What's this all of a sudden?\nAnd your attitude is different from-",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "149": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:342fad953176a599aa447972c7a0ac59c1a808f2d519e2228bb2f4a483d3401b",
      "text": "Heh! After all, I'm a third son\nnobody expects much from! I don't\neven have the power to take you in!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "153": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:22c455ced41d3f90be61db4bdb6b399484db6fbb32e2091ba519a8196d11017b",
      "text": "But there are plenty of ways. And my\neye for people and my connections\nare better than yours, I'm sure!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:079131a0c1fd2260585fcaffb1cebcb23f7d547147514f6d8b881192b8433f9e",
      "text": "Grace. Let's be friends!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9322cd5edbba4d4fcb5b5330288de64976779dce295b266050558da0af8b6c78",
      "text": "To realize the ideal we share, we'll\nrely on everything we can rely on!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "163": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9439621397e6cfb2f887777a6aa3d066ecca7e6c81b814e2abaa6d3331790d5a",
      "text": "...I like you better like this.\nThough you're not cool.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "166": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ed8f1a68fa748bc93c161e406a715369dc33630d5fe2a3f849990ffcc5e9f0f8",
      "text": "I know that well!\nBetter than anyone!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "169": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ffd7860e9df1e8b1612c763230fc3ea115fae15a2bade13b7c05533cc65368de",
      "text": "Hee hee... I see why Dul Kugala\nlooks out for you. You got me.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2a75915085ca8396b48d3109fe8dc3756a36da85322d8edff8804c78dfe6517f",
      "text": "You've won me over. As friends,\nlet's seize some good opportunities?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "175": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8718bd32bc6f31d85a4fb5b6033a635ccdec59da8e1e3b792d1529c6b1eae277",
      "text": "...Yes...! Of course! We'll make it\na success, and—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "182": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ce52594bcfccef958f43e87ab42ac6654735515e9d54e2da4e4b1701d1ab7fa",
      "text": "—A TOTAL FAILURE!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "186": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0ddf164fc6e60ae0ccc46fc213cb81565d6cefc44673f6afdde6d7bdd03e18bd",
      "text": "A-Alk!! Tell me!! What in the world\nam I supposed to do!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:244bb65ab65e7987e144f1555eabf185fd401e70dae44cdc67a2de5e363715e8",
      "text": "Wh-what? What happened??",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "195": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1d34e361fca69492af24b44f760d0983df287b4e0098ca8c20cdea68ec2893ea",
      "text": "It's Dul Kugala! She's contacted me\nand summoned me!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0c5cb25e30a27157417cd3d057b702ad70289b9445eef96cbfc104c516514958",
      "text": "A-actually, the woman I\nbefriended the other day\nis close with Dul Kugala.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "201": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:209b97b980e27832c0b20f64d34e1f1fc10d31589103818668d5c55d99502c03",
      "text": "Apparently it was a request from\nher, and part of scouting me out...!\nAnd the message I received says—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "205": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d921e81c386369ea339c08b5cfcd29852d8216d4361286320435fe66e563eb20",
      "text": "I want a good, long talk with you\nabout future trade with the Farlands.\nPlease treat it as important.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "209": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8f48f92a505b8e5a97690d051ffb1ee70fad09dc1a79465f11dba496ab631add",
      "text": "Let us hide nothing from each other.\nI hope we can speak frankly.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "214": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1f3d080db50c777a683889c2d4a4fd974bf316702f8a4148362321059bc67d2b",
      "text": "That feels like I'm DEFINITELY\ngetting scolded!! Why!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:86efa3de3e6288f5dd1d47c3bdeef9a4d2eca5be399c02f5f1521cba70daa0f4",
      "text": "A-ah... no, I think she actually\nlikes you, from Dul Kugala's—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "222": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6103ab6e6e9ecaefb94c21d0d7c21ced7bc27218380ade23f474c7a8c4bb4c7e",
      "text": "Please, Alk! Come with me! You're on\ngood terms with Dul Kugala, right!?\nWith you there, I won't be scolded!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "225": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ef47f0a6d01a2fac38630595e12f527a98946591901c88ea9ea7ba37adee327c",
      "text": "You're scared of that!? You were so\ncalm before!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "230": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c4698aa1e31744e6a103d3bb90cc5550b5b6e27bf07d7deb58fb272c63cb23d1",
      "text": "That's different! I have connections\nand an eye for people, but my courage\nis completely empty!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "234": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:71b0f8742ba8b68f5af40fab8846fb225a61d009b06a0697a2ec56a40d3431fe",
      "text": "W-what did I do wrong!? I didn't\ntalk money first this time!!?\nAaah, what do I doooo...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "238": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f26e42b81c37f8b8e319165d2836c86f42e3320ea932a580e289d80615bbe655",
      "text": "Feels like Libby's back to normal.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "241": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:adea646b55bcfddf5f9d29768b01f7d7b7206e74bcc17278905c4ccfa5b9e805",
      "text": "I kind of get that...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "247": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ce1eb3021f6943a1576420e1f3a06e56d1a8f275ec5ead138e94ab7e33e6be65",
      "text": "Hey! Are you listening!?\nBoth of you!!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
